# HabitFlow Environment Configuration Example

# Database Connection (Optional in local development)
# If left unset, HabitFlow automatically uses embedded PostgreSQL (PGlite) in ./data/habitflow_pg.
# For remote PostgreSQL or Neon in production:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@ep-sample-12345.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/habitflow?sslmode=require

# Node Environment
NODE_ENV=development
